# Stale compiled output of app/ceedmart/medusa-config.ts. We must NOT ship the
# locally-compiled .js because Node prefers .js over .ts when both are present
# in cwd, and the .ts is the canonical source we keep up to date. Let the
# container build regenerate the .js (or run from .ts via ts-node).
